{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57594","headline":"西王母授紫度炎光神变经颂三篇 一 · 无名氏","name":"西王母授紫度炎光神变经颂三篇 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"啸歌九玄台，崖岭凝凄端。\n心理六觉畅，目弃尘滓氛。\n流霞耀金室，虚堂散重玄。\n积感致灵降，形单道亦分。\n倏歘盼万劫，岂觉周亿椿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_57594.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57594","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}